# Environment Variables

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google sign-in for this app is handled by the Base44 platform, which performs
# the redirect to accounts.google.com on our behalf. Which Google project the
# user sees on the consent screen ("continue to …") is therefore decided by the
# OAuth client configured in the Base44 dashboard under
#   Dashboard → Settings → Authentication → Google → "Use a custom OAuth from
#   Google Console"
# NOT by anything in this repo.
#
# This file previously pinned
#   VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=342662050420-hjsrds4v122ggc6np9hlcgp0n2dt5rqd…
# which is *Base44's own platform client*, not ours — it is the client id the
# platform redirect already uses, and its redirect_uri is
# https://app.base44.com/api/apps/auth/callback. A Google Cloud project cannot
# be configured against it (we don't own it), and shipping it here invited
# exactly that mistake, so it has been removed.
#
# Set this ONLY if an in-app Google Identity Services flow is added using a
# client id from a Google Cloud project we control (see
# src/components/GoogleLoginButton.jsx). Leave it unset otherwise.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-own-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ── WhatsApp Cloud API — "Hello Biz" WABA (Zoa Zone Direct app) ──────────────
# Backend-only. These are read by the base44/functions/whatsapp* Deno functions
# via Deno.env.get(), so they belong in the Base44 builder's secrets tab — NOT
# here, and never with a VITE_ prefix (Vite inlines every VITE_ var into the
# public bundle, which would leak the system-user token to every browser).
# This file documents the exact variable names the code reads.
#
# App    : Zoa Zone Direct   (2266003414253985)
# WABA   : Hello Biz         (1742983153672564)
# Number : +1 (256) 699-8899 (902301109637859)
# Webhook: https://zoazoneservices.com/webhook.php  (shared PHP relay)
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID="902301109637859"
WHATSAPP_WABA_ID="1742983153672564"
WHATSAPP_SYSTEM_USER_TOKEN="<PASTE_SYSTEM_USER_TOKEN_HERE>"
WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN="my_custom_secret_token_123"
WHATSAPP_GRAPH_API_URL="https://graph.facebook.com/v20.0"

# App secret for the Zoa Zone Direct app (App Dashboard → Settings → Basic).
# Verifies Meta's X-Hub-Signature-256 on inbound deliveries, so that anyone who
# learns the webhook URL still cannot inject fake messages.
WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET="<PASTE_APP_SECRET_HERE>"

# Shared secret between the zoazoneservices.com PHP relay and whatsappWebhook.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
WHATSAPP_RELAY_TOKEN="<PASTE_RELAY_TOKEN_HERE>"

# Automatic replies are opt-in. With neither of these set, a thread in
# auto-pilot simply stays unread for a human — which is the safe default.
#   WHATSAPP_AI_FUNCTION       a deployed function that returns { reply: "..." }
#   WHATSAPP_AUTO_ACK_TEMPLATE an approved template, sent once per thread
WHATSAPP_AI_FUNCTION=""
WHATSAPP_AUTO_ACK_TEMPLATE=""
WHATSAPP_AUTO_ACK_LANGUAGE="en_US"
